  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 802.09 Sub-watershed",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 802.09 “Sub-watershed” means a drainage area of approximately 20,000 acres, equivalent to a 6th-level HUC 12-digit watershed.\n\nSource. #12808, eff 12-15-19 (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wt 800)",
